## Decisions and Action Items

* **Guides Program Profile Refresh**: Wes Hardaker to issue a call to existing guides to update their working group expertise profiles and recruit additional mentors post-meeting.
* **Outreach Coordination**: Working group chairs and community members participating in external industry events are requested to log their attendance on the [EODIR Outreach Wiki](https://wiki.ietf.org/group/eodir/outreach).
* **Student Program Tracking**: Akansha Gandotra to share the standardized survey questionnaire with regional student program organizers to gather unified tracking data.

